  m_text: The dance is inspired by the traditional song Leron, Leron Sinta, which
    depicts images of nature such as trees, bees, birds, and insects. Over time,
    Lerion evolved to include expressive movements that reflect love and courtship,
    integrated with elements from the natural environment.
