  m_text: "Step into the world of Lerion through our virtual reality experience.
    Engage with the dance\u2019s rhythmic movements, explore its natural inspirations,
    and experience the rich cultural traditions of Parang, Marikina in a fully immersive
    environment. Discover how the dance brings together community spirit and nature
    in a captivating way."
