  m_Text: "Objective Explanation\n\n\nStarting Simulations \n\nBegin with basic modules
    that introduce the fundamental steps of Lerion and Cari\xF1osa.\nPractice in
    immersive virtual environments designed to mimic traditional dance settings,
    helping users understand the flow and rhythm of each dance."
