      m_Calls: []
  m_text: " Performers of Cari\xF1osa traditionally wear elegant Maria Clara gowns
    for women and Barong Tagalog for men. These costumes not only reflect Spanish
    influence but also embody Filipino national pride and identity. Beyond its historical
    context, Cari\xF1osa is a celebration of romance and courtship. Its lively movements
    and graceful gestures illustrate the charm and courtship rituals of traditional
    Filipino society."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
