  m_Text: 'Objective Explanation



    Improving Skills


    As users advance,
    they gain access to modules focusing on more intricate dance sequences.

    The
    structured design encourages users to perfect their movements, improving technique
    and timing with consistent practice.

    Users can revisit earlier simulations
    to strengthen foundational skills.'
