  m_Text: "Objective Explanation\n\n\nAccessing Challenges\n\nAfter mastering the
    basics, users unlock challenges that test their ability to perform dance routines.
    \nChallenges are designed to simulate different scenarios, such as cultural events,
    encouraging deeper engagement and skill application."
